{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Teams｜结构图\n玩家编队的持久层次。装配/换人顺序见 [[GGYGO_流程_队伍与装配.canvas|流程图]]；[[Teams/结构|结构文档]]。Boss 只共用底层宿主契约。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1480,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "presets",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOSquadPresets\n`SetPresetMembers(Index, IDs)` → 保存资产 ID。\n`SetActivePresetIndex(Index)` → 选出战预设。\n`ResolveActivePresetRoster(Out)` → 解析本局成员。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "state",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOPlayerState\n拥有 `UGGYGOSquadComponent`；队伍数据跨 Pawn 死亡/更换仍保留。",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 195,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOPlayerController\n`Possess(Pawn)` → 控制出战 Avatar。\n`PostProcessInput()` → 调当前 ASC 消费本帧能力输入。",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 1030,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "squad",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOSquadComponent\n`SetRoster(Data[])` → 装配前设置名单。\n`RegisterSlot(Slot)` → 登记已创建位置。\n`GetActiveSlot()` / `SwitchToSlot(Index)` → 当前出战与换人。\n持有 Roster、Slots、ActiveSlotIndex。",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 565,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "slot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterSlot\n`InitializeForPawnData(Data)` → 授予 AbilitySets / 配 ASC 规则。\n继承 `AttachAvatar(Pawn)`；每个 Slot 独立 HealthSet / CombatSet。",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 578,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "base",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCombatantState\n`GetGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent()` → 访问持久 ASC。\n`AttachAvatar(Pawn)` / `DetachAvatar(Expected)` → 更新 ActorInfo 与复制引用。",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 215,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pawn",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterBase / PawnExtension\n`InitializeAbilitySystem(ASC, Owner)` → Pawn 接入 Slot 持有的 GAS 状态。\n换人不重建 Slot。",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 1035,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 编队、宿主与控制权接口链\nSquadPresets::ResolveActivePresetRoster(OutRoster) → SquadComponent::SetRoster(PawnData[])：存档意图先于局内装配。\nGameMode::SpawnSquadSlot → Slot::InitializeForPawnData → AbilitySet::GiveToAbilitySystem；GameMode::SpawnSquadMember → Slot::AttachAvatar(Pawn) → PawnExtension::InitializeAbilitySystem。\nSquadComponent::RegisterSlot → SwitchToSlot(Index) → PlayerController::Possess(Pawn)：只换控制权和 ActiveSlotIndex，待命 Slot/ASC 不销毁。\nBossState 仅共用 CombatantState 的 ASC/Avatar 契约，不参加 Squad/Presets。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
